# Decor bush, native 32x24 frames: idle, brush1 (leaning with the hero), brush2 (rebound), settle.
# The runtime mirrors the sheet for the hero's heading, so the lean is drawn once. Bottom row rests on the floor.
size 32 24
color k 0b0814
color d 3b2a5c
color m 5a4488
color l 7a5ab0
color n 8a8a2a
color N 4a4a18
